<p>Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>1. Arshe bari ho jiska musalla<br> sajda jise karta ho qibla<br> jiski sukunat sehne kaaba<br> jiska amama gumbade khazra<br> jisse hai aabru, deene khuda ki wo hussain<br> haideri zebo zayn, fatima zehra ka hai chayn<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>2. Shane qayadat roohe imamat<br> jiski mawaddat ajre risalat<br> barsare naiza husne tilawat<br> sabr hai jaisa waisi shaja'at<br> aye shahe mashraqayn, aye dil o jaane karbala<br> aap hi ibteda, aap hi ishq ki intehaa<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>3. Chehra tera wan-najm ki surat<br> gesu tere wal-layl ki aayat<br> badr e tamami qad aur qamat<br> aankho ki hai wan-noor alamat<br> qalbe qur'an ke, noor mein baham hai hussain<br> usme ek lafz hai, uska mujassam hai hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>4. Hurr se dilawar kya the, kya hai<br> rahib o fitrus tujhpe fida hai<br> jitne shaheede karbobala hai<br> teri ataa pe mehwe sanaa hai<br> sura e rehman ki, puchiye kya tafseer hai<br> khud kahega khuda, bus wo mera shabbir hai<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>5. Karbobala ab humko bulaye<br> farshe zamee'n par arsh dikhaye<br> khake shifa dastaar banaye<br> roze pe tere sar ko jhukaye<br> karbala naam hai, ishq ki us me'raj ka<br> paa sake koshishe, karke bhi na jise ambiya<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>6. Kaisi sahar ashoor ki aayi<br> kaisi sitam ki aandhi chhayi<br> baqi rahe na bete bhai<br> roti rahi tujh par tanhai<br> ran ko jo bhi gaya, tujhpe fida hota raha<br> ro rahi hai aaj bhi, gham me tumhare karbala<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p> 
<p>7. Fakhr hame salman o raza hai<br> humko mayassar farsh e azaa hai<br> fatima zehra ki ye ataa hai<br> lab pe hamare jo nauha hai<br> baadshahi se badh-kar, hai hamari naukri<br> dhadkane qalb hai, naam e hussain ibn e ali<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain<br> Ishq e ali o zahra hussain<br> Ya Hussain, Ya Hussain</p>